Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:35:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 10/14] airconv: SV_Barycentrics and GetAttributeAtVertex

SV_Barycentrics maps to [[barycentric_coord]] and gets a register after the packed inputs.
GetAttributeAtVertex on float inputs: the input is read without perspective (pull mode) together with
no-perspective barycentrics; both are affine in screen space, so value and screen derivatives give three
equations for the three vertex values, solved in the prologue. Works on all Metal 3 GPUs (vertex_value<T>
compiles on Apple9 but returns wrong data). Integer and half inputs get the flat value for every vertex.
